<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jona</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jona</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Jona chekhai, now arui khin dow 765-753 BC takra kowi chekhai. Jona dow Thurai hown lusa maru takra kowi kowh tek lai mih risi chekhai. Risiuüa ruiah mih bowih maten kowi Jona ruiah mih bowih dow alangma. Akeng mih risiuüa dow kowmatia lawnguan kowi lak-e Thurai hownia ka ana kowh amatni cham phuangah mih laiklow kowi lang rui hu chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Jona dow Thurai peah ana mih laiklow lak-e aiamat chownglawng kowi tawng chow own mih lawnguan kowi lang rui hu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jona chowng khe Israeluüa kowh ransu lang iuk mih hai kramra lang uowi mih dow Asuria siphaiuüa chekhai. Asuria pren dow Israel pren tawngphak hai satlawt prakowi chekhai. Ninevi dow Asuria pren kowi kowh marow kri chekhai; nami dow kawmat kowh Irag pren kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami khin khe Ninevi marow kowi kowh maru-uüa dow lainowmma ngah khai. Naiawng rakowi angak hownia natarip kown mih lai nakowtek pe kownkow Jona kowi Thurai kowchinah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh ransu Ninevi marowchakuüa tarip hanow Thurai ripra hownia nakhalat kown mih Jona dow mapaw nau dowi. Naiawng rakowi Jona dow Thurai chinah mih Ninevi marow prakowi tarü dowi kowi akeng pra kowh alakma mih Tarsis marow kowi cham powt kownkow chawnlawng hown tarü khai. Tarsis marow dow Israel pren satkup prakowi chekhai; nami dow kawmat kowh Spain pren kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nachenganchepaw Ninevi marow kowi nakowkowi ngengche kownkow Jona vüi CHAKRAMANG mih kamrüt pe tiama lowk khai. Jona kowi naiawnah kownkow dam aiukma mih CHAKRAMANG kowchin pe lowk khai, now Jona dow nami dam mu lak kowi sum ni hai sum uar uowila khai. Jona dow Ninevi marowchakuüa vüi amat müa chekhai, nami iawng dow kawmat chowng kowh maru-uüa vüi maru chapa (Isu Krista) dow amat müa naown kown (Luka 11:30). Nami dam dow Ninevi kowi Jona ia kowila kown mih rah kowi cham owrah khai; naiawngün dow mami bowih kowi kowh awdara lup laipre buk mih kowi awdara lang uowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Now khawlawt dowi rakowi Ninevi marow kowi Jona kowtek lai hanow Ninevi maru-uüa dow angak hownia tarip khai; amatni tarip mih natüngla kownkow aiuk asowm sala uan khup büah hanow plawi dawng kowi chowm büah khai. Nami klen kowi maru hai tawncher maten tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi kowi kham ngare büah khai. Nami khi hanow CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow Ninevi marowchakuüa kowi ripah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Jona dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai luk kowi mapaw sak-ih dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Plang kuak: Plang kuak pami dow alai chowng khe kowh maru-uüa mih kuak plang now pu lak kowi matah mih hua pre buk, nadowi now tow pe kuaisek reng chekhai. Now nami pu mih sowkah hanow nakowi kowh towah mih huaklu hai kuaisek dow anaima mih arah kowi cham khükah reng chekhai. Nakhowk khe rik dow mih iawng dowkah büah reng chekhai. Nakhu angak kown mih khin khe paw tawng mih ruachow kaurawng kowi nacham lawtah kown mih natukla kownkow rik kuak pe plang reng chekhai (Levi 16:8), now plang kowi kowh cha iawng rua mih cham lawtah reng chekhai. Israel krungchak hai kimchakuüa Kanan pren kowi tabak krawng bawn khe paw naiawng kuak pe plang reng chekhai (Plan rui 26:55).</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Jona chün lai dowi mih 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Jona tarip mih hai ka lawngra mih 2:1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineviuüa kowi Jona kowtek pe Thurai lai mih 3:1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineviuüa kowi Thurai saksing sanaah mih 4:1-11</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Jona chün lai dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Akat khe Amitai kowh chapa Jona tut-e mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. Jona kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Ninevi marow aiukma mih kowi kowkowi diah. Amatni kowh angak krang dow ang pur kowi uang towm khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ang kingküaah mih laiklow amatni kowi kowphowng pe dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi powtta kownkow Jona dow akeng pra kowh marow Tarsis kowi tarü khai. Aia dow sata pang kowi kowh Jopa kua kowi kowkowi hanow Tarsis marow prakowi mang kown mih chawnlawng kowka khai. Aia dow chawnlawng kowi kowpün now achowm sung mih peta khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowi powtta kownkow tarü khai bowt.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow sata kowi kowchin pe liku khai, now liku kür lai rakowi chawnlawng dow piak kown powm iawng phaw khai. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Naiawng rakowi chawnlawng kowi kowh lup chang miuüa maten dow karla sawm se amatni chowlowkkow kawngmu thurai kowi lü khowng büah khai. Now chawnlawng nahowpla kownkow chawnlawng kowi kowh amatni kowh uanh mih sata kowi kuakta büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:5">Nachenganchepaw nami dowi rawn Jona dow chawnlawng daw kowi kowrik kowiah hanow kowmawk khai, now asowrma kowmüi khai. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Nami khin khe chawnlawng kowi kowh lang kri mih Jona tut-e kowkowiah hanow tek pe mih, “Tawng en tuk müi khai? Rü bowt. A-i nakowngla dowi kownkow en kowh thurai kowi haw bowt, aia mih natuak a-i tarawng,” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Now chawnlawng kowi kowh lup chang miuüa tatek mih, “Amia rakowi chow maiawng mih phih a-i luk kowi uang towm mih natukla kownkow chu madiah a-i kuak plang madiah sik,” pabüah khai. Now kuak plang büah hanow plang dow Jona ming kowi chekhai cha khai.<verse eid="JON 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Nahanow amatni dow Jona kowi lüntaah mih, “Tek anging madiah, amia rakowi chow mami phih a-i tut-e uang towm mih? Tawng lup chow en chang? Tawng hownia chow en uang? Tawng prenchak chow en? Tawng chenchap chow en?” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Nakhowk khe Jona klangah mih, “Ang dow Hebrai maru taih. Ang dow krawng hai sata thawp mih CHAKRAMANG mukuang kowi uowi mih Thurai kowi ringkaw mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Nahanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG hownia cham powt mih pahai Jona tek pe khai rakowi tuk büah hanow kut kram ngamlam büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Jona kowi tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Now liku uang kür ngamlam rakowi Jona kowi lüntaah büah mih, “Sata tuilowng narimla kownkow tawng chow anging nachang en kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Nakhowk khe Jona klangah mih, “Krowng ang büah hanow sata kowi kuak ang büah bowt. Nahanow sata tuilowng narim kown taih. Ang tuk, mami liku akraingma mih enni luk kowi uang towm mih dow ang rakowi chowtaih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Nachenganchepaw chawnlawng kowi kowh lup chang miuüa dow naiawng changah büah dowi chekhai; naiawng lak-e chawnlawng kowi sata pang prakowi napawla kownkow amatni kowh kür maten hown haiah büah khai. Nachenganchepaw liku dow uang kür ngamlam rakowi nowng pawla büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami maru kowng rakowi hauang pe kowngla anging diah. Maru angak uowi dowi mih lowk ia kowng rakowi hauang tang anging aprek diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow en matia nau iawng en chang lup reng chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JON 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Jona kowi dowkah now sata kowi kuakta büah khai. Nahanow sata tui talowng phunglung mih dow uang rim khai bowt. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Naiawng rakowi nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lainowmma kram büah khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi asadua ün ngenah hanow chang phuchua büah khai, now laikham ün takham büah khai.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Now CHAKRAMANG mih Jona kowi naiawnah kownkow dam aiukma mih kowkhowm pe lowk khai. Jona dow nami dam mu lak kowi sum ni hown sum uar uowi khai.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Dam mu lak hownia Jona chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Jona dow nami dam mu lak hownia CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kowi awr chup khai. <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Jona tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang ngare mih khin khe ang haw en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">ang hawk klow dow en ta hanow en uang khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">
    <char style="w">Makowng nimkrüa</char> abüpma mih hownia ang haw en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">khowng ang kownkow ang haw en khe ang klow en ta khai.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Sata thingh, tui abüpma kowi en kuak ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">Nami khin khe tui ahuma ang riaret kowi uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">en kowh tuilowng maten dow ang luk kowi uang hawr khai.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />‘En mik khi hownia alakma kowi en prütta ang khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">nachepaw en kowh kim chimsaima prakowi ang plan dang iawk kown,’ ang pakhai.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Sata tui dow pawta ang asak kownkow nipla ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">sata tui dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">nakowi kowh mawh dow piata ang lu khai.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Sata tui kowi ang tamir khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">ang tamir kowh hungh tut kowi pat ang kowting khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Kowng miuüa uowi rah iawng mih kowi ang cham uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">achowngma vüi kowi ang cham takhang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Nachenganchepaw aw ang kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">nami hownia en uang lawtla ang khai.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang sak that ngialia khe ang ka tuak en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">ang chup en mih dow en chupra kim chimsaima kowi uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">Nami dow en tut-e uang towm khai.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Anowm nadowi mih arup aren maten kowi chup miuüa dow en saksing sanara nowngia ka kown chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">Tawkchedow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura nau büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Lawngra lup dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ngengche chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Naiawng rakowi awmrawm meng ang natek en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">tawncher hown ang naphuchua en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Ang takhamah mih ang nachang en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih dam kowi peah ana khai, now dam dow Jona kowi süng akangma kowi kowowrta khai bowt.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Jona chün lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Nami kung kowi paw CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih Jona tut-e uang ting khai iawk. <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jona mih, “Awr rü hanow Ninevi marow aiukma mih kowi kowkowi diah. Now ang natek en kown mih laiklow kowphuang pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Now Jona dow awr rü hanow CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng Ninevi marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Ninevi dow marow aiukma chekhai; aphia krang paw sum ni mang rawng chekhai. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Jona dow nami marow kowi kowkup hanow pani mang rawng kowmang khai. Nahanow aia dow, “Kawmat hownia likawm ni kung kowi Ninevi marow dow napiak kown,” padow kowkrawi phuang khai.<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninevi marowchakuüa tarip mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Nakhowk khe Ninevi marowchakuüa dow Thurai kowh laiklow kowi owm büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow nakhang hawm kownkow phuang büah khai, now angak hownia amatni tarip mih krang natüng büah kownkow aiuk asowm sala uan khup büah khai. <verse eid="JON 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün laiklow dow Ninevi marow mang paw tawi ta khai. Nahanow aia dow aia kowh mang chowm rah hownia awr rü now aia kowh mang tawnguat mih klüpta khai. Now angak hownia tarip mih krang natawi tüng kownkow sala uan tawi khup hanow plawi kowi tawi chowm khai bowt. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Now aia dow lawt ana hanow aia kowh maru iukuüa hown Ninevi marow lak kowi maiawng krawi phuang khai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 3:7">“Maru maten mih tawngpaw hang pacham cha hang pacham kham lah. Nami klen kowi chia hawmh hai ruapur hawmh kowi paw hang pacham thingah lah. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Maru hai tawncher mih sala uan pacham khup lah. Maru maten mih kür uowi mowr Thurai kowi pacham haw lah, now lup ngak hai kuk damra lup maten pacham towta lah. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />A-i napiakla dowi kownkow Thurai dow aia kunmarau lün pluplup mih hownia naplanta sak chepaw naia, amia chow tuk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Nahanow amatni kowh angak hownia tawng iawng chow uang plan mih hai amatni chang mih krang ün khi hanow Thurai dow planta sak khai. Now naripah kown pahai aia tekta khowk mih dow ripah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi Jona kunmarauah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Nachenganchepaw Jona dow naiawng phaw mih mapaw sak-ih dowi rakowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Naiawng kowh aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi awr tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, maiawng naown kown mih anging pren kowi ang uowi khe hownia ang tuk chowdiah. Tarsis marow prakowi ang powt mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. En dow saksing sanara atekma mih Thurai, en dow kunmarau naklak dowi, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow katpaw khowk dowi, napeah ripra kown mih lawnguan kowi planta saktuak reng pami ang tuk chowdiah. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sing uowi kown mih lak-e kowng mih ang vüi lang iung chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat pawta ang asak diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “En kunmarau mih tawngpaw auan uowi dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Nami kung kowi Jona dow marow uat satlawt prakowi kowkowiah hanow kowthawp te lowk khai, now nami klim kowi kowchowm khai. Aia dow marow kowi tawng chow phaw kown mih khila kownkow chawngah khai.<verse eid="JON 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dum ruih hai dungh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih nakowi dow dum pe ruah atut khai. Nami ruih dow awr iuk hanow Jona kawm mih na-ela kownkow aia lu kowi peah klim khai. Naiawng rakowi Jona dow nami ruih luk kowi lainowmma awmrawm khai. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Tawkchedow auai ni murpa Thurai uang chin pe dungh khai; nami dungh dow ruih kowi krawi kremta now ruih dow keu khai. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Now sat uang lawt hanow Thurai mih satlawt li adenma mih uang pe uangah khai; nahanow nami sat dow Jona lu kowi adenma uang iu denah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow maw ngialia own khai. Aia dow kowng kown nau rakowi tek mih, “Sing uowi kown mih lak-e kowng mih che ang vüi lang iung rowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Nakhowk khe Jona kowi Thurai tek pe mih, “Paimi dum rakowi en kunmarau mih tawngpaw auan uowi dowi,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Now Jona klangah mih, “Ang kunmaraula mih auan uowi, kowng pat ang nakunmarau kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mami dum kowi kawm paw en kawmah dowi, khet paw en khetah dowi, nachepaw en sanaah khai. Nami dow aiak sang uang awr ru hanow aiak sang kowng khai. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Nachenganchepaw Ninevi kowi dow 120,000 ia lak-e hu hawmlawm lakuai tuk dowi tak mih ngeuüa uowi. Nami klen kowi chia hai ruapur paw ahuma uowi. Nahanow tawng chow ang nachangah kown? Nami marow aiukma mih kowi ang sanaah dowk ü?” pape khai.<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>